# Git commits

- Never add `Co-authored-by:` trailers to commit messages (including `Co-authored-by: Cursor`).
- Use a single-line subject or short subject + body; only the human author's identity belongs on the commit.
- The repo `.githooks/prepare-commit-msg` hook removes any Co-authored-by lines if they are added by mistake.
